# Phase 10 Production Baseline (FROZEN)

Phase 10 **Future Path Vision** is **production certified** and frozen at engine version **v1.0.0**.

Treat the current implementation as the regression baseline for all future counseling milestones (Phase 11+).

## Freeze contract (stable)

Phase 10 **strengthens confidence only** and helps the student imagine their future learning journey on the path already recommended.

It must **never**:

- Recommend colleges again
- Change Phase 5 / Phase 9 recommendations or rankings
- Compare colleges again
- Resolve objections (Phase 11)
- Recommend counseling / introduce counsellors
- Perform booking or hint at WhatsApp booking
- Perform human handoff
- Guarantee placements, salaries, internships, or admissions
- Call an LLM
- Repeat Phase 9 synthesis / trade-off lists
- Exceed the WhatsApp response budget (max 2–3 short bubbles; one idea per message)

It may **only**:

- Anchor lightly on Phase 9 Best Match as the already-chosen path
- Personalize future-learning possibilities from profile (goal, course, learning style, interests)
- Use possibility language (not promises)
- Transition on `continue` into Phase 11 final decision hesitation (approved handoff-only delta)

## Do not change unless

- Fixing a **verified bug** or **regression** against this baseline
- User explicitly requests a Phase 10 change with acknowledged freeze risk

## Frozen stage chain

```
… → phase_9_personalized_recommendation   (FROZEN v1.1.0)
  → phase_10_future_path_vision            (FROZEN v1.0.0)
  → phase_11_final_decision_hesitation     (FROZEN v1.1.0)
       ├─ → counseling_invitation          (Phase 12 stub; Section E CTA unchanged)
       └─ → hesitation_escalation / niat_interest_one_on_one (OOO URL)
  → conversation_complete
```

